After a restart ⇧⌘T opened the window the last quit had closed (the session had already
brought it back), and a tab closed before the restart came back in a new window (its own
was gone). A closed Little window came back as a window too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
